		"Block Cyrillic characters" => "Bloquear caracteres cirílicos",
		"Useful for sites that only expect Latin-script comments." => "Útil para sitios que solo esperan comentarios en escritura latina.",
		"Skip checks for logged-in users" => "Omitir comprobaciones para usuarios conectados",
		"Log blocked attempts" => "Registrar intentos bloqueados",
		"Min. seconds before submit" => "Segundos mínimos antes de enviar",
		"Max. form age (seconds)" => "Antigüedad máxima del formulario (segundos)",
		"Max comments per IP" => "Máximo de comentarios por IP",
		"Rate limit window (minutes)" => "Ventana del límite de frecuencia (minutos)",
		"Max links in comment" => "Máximo de enlaces en el comentario",
		"Duplicate window (minutes)" => "Ventana de duplicados (minutos)",
		"Action on spam" => "Acción ante el spam",
		"Mark as spam" => "Marcar como spam",
		"Move to trash" => "Mover a la papelera",
		"Reject with error (do not save)" => "Rechazar con error (no guardar)",
		"For effectiveness similar to dedicated anti-spam plugins, enable a cloud check. Local rules still run as a second layer." => "Para una eficacia similar a los plugins anti-spam dedicados, active una comprobación en la nube. Las reglas locales siguen como segunda capa.",
		"Cloud mode" => "Modo en la nube",
		"Off (local rules only)" => "Desactivado (solo reglas locales)",
		"Akismet (requires Akismet plugin + API key)" => "Akismet (requiere el plugin Akismet + clave API)",
		"Akismet plugin is not active. Install and configure Akismet or choose another mode." => "El plugin Akismet no está activo. Instale y configure Akismet o elija otro modo.",
		"CleanTalk access key" => "Clave de acceso CleanTalk",
		"Only used when Cloud mode is CleanTalk. You can reuse your existing CleanTalk key without keeping their plugin active." => "Solo se usa cuando el modo en la nube es CleanTalk. Puede reutilizar su clave CleanTalk sin mantener su plugin activo.",
